"use strict";(self.webpackChunkicecat_connector_doc=self.webpackChunkicecat_connector_doc||[]).push([[383],{3307(e,t,n){n.r(t),n.d(t,{comp:()=>a,data:()=>r});var c=n(641);const o={},a=(0,n(6262).A)(o,[["render",function(e,t){const n=(0,c.g2)("RouteLink");return(0,c.uX)(),(0,c.CE)("div",null,[t[7]||(t[7]=(0,c.Fv)('<h1 id="icecat-account" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#icecat-account"><span>Icecat Account</span></a></h1><p>Every catalog request the connector makes is authenticated with your Icecat username. The <strong>Account</strong> tab (<strong>Webkul WC Addons → IceCat Connector → Account</strong>) shows the connection at a glance and is where you edit or remove it.</p><hr><h2 id="open-icecat-vs-full-icecat" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#open-icecat-vs-full-icecat"><span>Open Icecat vs Full Icecat</span></a></h2><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>Open Icecat (free)</th><th>Full Icecat (paid)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cost</td><td>Free — <a href="https://icecat.biz/registration" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">register here</a></td><td>Paid Icecat subscription</td></tr><tr><td>Catalog coverage</td><td>Products of Icecat&#39;s <strong>sponsoring brands</strong></td><td>The complete Icecat catalog</td></tr><tr><td>What the connector needs</td><td>Username only</td><td>Username <strong>plus App Key</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The <strong>App Key</strong> is found on your <a href="https://icecat.biz/en/user" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">My Profile</a> page at icecat.biz. Without it, searching a Full-Icecat-only product returns the error <em>&quot;To access Full Icecat content, an app_key is required.&quot;</em>, and some brands return <em>&quot;Product has brand restrictions or access is limited.&quot;</em></p><h2 id="the-connection-card" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#the-connection-card"><span>The Connection Card</span></a></h2><p>When an account is connected, the tab shows a status card:</p><p><img src="/woocommerce-icecat-connector/images/icecat-connector/account-connected.webp" alt="The Account tab with a verified Icecat connection"></p>',9)),(0,c.Lk)("ul",null,[t[4]||(t[4]=(0,c.Fv)("<li><strong>Connection badges</strong> — <em>Connected / Not Verified</em> and the account mode (<em>Open Icecat</em>).</li><li><strong>Username</strong> — the Icecat account in use.</li><li><strong>Connection Status</strong> — <em>Verified</em> once the username has passed a live API check.</li>",3)),(0,c.Lk)("li",null,[t[1]||(t[1]=(0,c.Lk)("strong",null,"Catalog Language",-1)),t[2]||(t[2]=(0,c.eW)(" — the default import language (change it in the ",-1)),(0,c.bF)(n,{to:"/icecat-connector/setup-wizard.html"},{default:(0,c.k6)(()=>[...t[0]||(t[0]=[(0,c.eW)("Setup Wizard",-1)])]),_:1}),t[3]||(t[3]=(0,c.eW)(" preferences or per import).",-1))]),t[5]||(t[5]=(0,c.Lk)("li",null,[(0,c.Lk)("strong",null,"API Endpoint"),(0,c.eW)(" — always "),(0,c.Lk)("code",null,"live.icecat.biz"),(0,c.eW)(".")],-1)),t[6]||(t[6]=(0,c.Lk)("li",null,[(0,c.Lk)("strong",null,"App Key (Full Icecat)"),(0,c.eW)(" — masked when saved, or "),(0,c.Lk)("em",null,'"Not added — Open Icecat only"'),(0,c.eW)(".")],-1))]),t[8]||(t[8]=(0,c.Fv)('<h2 id="edit-the-connection" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#edit-the-connection"><span>Edit the Connection</span></a></h2><p>Click <strong>Edit Connection</strong> to change the username or App Key.</p><p><img src="/woocommerce-icecat-connector/images/icecat-connector/account-edit-connection.webp" alt="The Edit Connection form with username and App Key fields"></p><ol><li>Enter the <strong>Open Icecat Username</strong> (required).</li><li>Optionally enter the <strong>App Key</strong> — leave it empty for free Open Icecat accounts.</li><li>Click <strong>Save &amp; Verify</strong>.</li></ol><p>The connector saves the details and verifies them live:</p><ul><li>The username is checked against an Open Icecat product.</li><li>A saved App Key is additionally checked against Full-Icecat-only content — a wrong key is rejected with a clear message rather than silently ignored.</li></ul><p>Success returns you to the Account tab with the <em>Connected</em> badge; failure shows <em>&quot;Connection to Icecat failed. Please check your username and try again.&quot;</em> without breaking the previously verified state.</p><div class="hint-container tip"><p class="hint-container-title">First-time connection</p><p>When no username is saved yet, the Edit Connection screen shows a registration callout — follow the <strong>registration</strong> link to create a free Open Icecat account, then come back and save it.</p></div><h2 id="delete-the-account" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#delete-the-account"><span>Delete the Account</span></a></h2><p>Click <strong>Delete Account</strong> on the connection card. A confirmation dialog warns:</p><blockquote><p>Are you sure you want to delete the Icecat account &quot;…&quot;? Product imports will stop working until you connect an account again.</p></blockquote><p>Confirming removes the saved username and App Key and marks the connection as not verified. Products already imported stay in your store — only new imports and updates stop until you connect an account again.</p><h2 id="troubleshooting" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#troubleshooting"><span>Troubleshooting</span></a></h2><table><thead><tr><th>Symptom</th><th>Cause</th><th>Fix</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><em>&quot;…the Icecat user is unknown&quot;</em></td><td>Username typo, or the account doesn&#39;t exist</td><td>Check the spelling; <a href="https://icecat.biz/registration" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">register</a> if needed</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;The App Key could not be verified…&quot;</em></td><td>Wrong or expired App Key</td><td>Copy the key from <a href="https://icecat.biz/en/user" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">My Profile</a>, or clear it to use Open Icecat</td></tr><tr><td>Verification times out</td><td>The server can&#39;t reach <code>live.icecat.biz</code></td><td>Allow outbound HTTPS from your hosting to <code>live.icecat.biz</code></td></tr></tbody></table>',14))])}]]),r=JSON.parse('{"path":"/icecat-connector/account.html","title":"Icecat Account","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{"title":"Icecat Account","description":"Connect, verify, edit, or delete the Icecat account the connector uses — and understand Open Icecat vs Full Icecat and the App Key."},"headers":[{"level":2,"title":"Open Icecat vs Full Icecat","slug":"open-icecat-vs-full-icecat","link":"#open-icecat-vs-full-icecat","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"The Connection Card","slug":"the-connection-card","link":"#the-connection-card","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Edit the Connection","slug":"edit-the-connection","link":"#edit-the-connection","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Delete the Account","slug":"delete-the-account","link":"#delete-the-account","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Troubleshooting","slug":"troubleshooting","link":"#troubleshooting","children":[]}],"git":{},"filePathRelative":"icecat-connector/account.md"}')}}]);